# The Fighting Fourth (crystalWar 7) completed by a GM, with no campaign allegiance: its completed replies against the
# NPCs' other answers. A level 99 Warrior in the Eldieme Necropolis [S] (missions as Steamed Rams' main flow).
# Turbulent Storm: the quest's 9 (replaceDefault), then the script's 7 (no allegiance, no RED letter); the RED letter (a
# GM): the quest's 9, then the script's 8. Bastok Markets [S], Her Memories: Azure Footfalls (group 10, on Lua) accepted
# at Prog 5 (GMs): Adelbrecht: 162 (replaceDefault) under Azure's 360 (a Progress): 360 (Azure completed); Azure
# accepted at Prog 5 again: 360 again. North Gustaberg [S] (Better Part of Valor's zone-in 1 plays: an opener is
# completed), Azure accepted at Prog 2: Gebhardt: 108 (replaceDefault) under Azure's 14 (a Progress): 14; Azure's Prog
# set back: 14 again.
lists TheEldiemeNecropolisS/Turbulent_Storm/onTrigger BastokMarketsS/Adelbrecht/onTrigger NorthGustabergS/Gebhardt/onTrigger
char zone=TheEldiemeNecropolisS pos=423.961,-48,-47.308 job=WAR lvl=99
quest CrystalWar.TheFightingFourth completed
mission Wotg BackToTheBeginning current
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
login
trigger Turbulent_Storm                 # completed: the quest's 9
finish
trigger Turbulent_Storm                 # the script's 7 (no allegiance, no RED letter)
finish option=1                         # nothing
keyitem RedRecommendationLetter
trigger Turbulent_Storm                 # the quest's 9
finish
trigger Turbulent_Storm                 # the script's 8 (the RED letter)
finish
quest CrystalWar.HerMemoriesAzureFootfalls accepted
charvar Quest[7][70]Prog 5
warp -324.266,-12.601,-76.977 BastokMarketsS
trigger Adelbrecht                      # completed: 162 (replaceDefault) under Azure Footfalls' 360: 360
finish                                  # Azure completed
quest CrystalWar.HerMemoriesAzureFootfalls available
quest CrystalWar.HerMemoriesAzureFootfalls accepted
charvar Quest[7][70]Prog 5
trigger Adelbrecht                      # 360 again
finish
quest CrystalWar.HerMemoriesAzureFootfalls available
quest CrystalWar.HerMemoriesAzureFootfalls accepted
charvar Quest[7][70]Prog 2
warp 207.799,-20.826,669.125 NorthGustabergS
trigger Gebhardt                        # completed: 108 (replaceDefault) under Azure Footfalls' 14: 14
finish                                  # Azure Prog 3
charvar Quest[7][70]Prog 2
trigger Gebhardt                        # 14 again
finish
